sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor TEK as Teknisi
  participant SPA as Aplikasi HP
  participant API as Server API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant PSH as Web Push
  actor PGW as Pengawas
  TEK->>SPA: Isi form, butir Rusak<br/>dengan catatan dan foto
  SPA->>SPA: Kecilkan foto,<br/>periksa kelengkapan
  SPA->>API: POST /api/p2h<br/>Bearer, client_uuid
  API->>API: Periksa token, peran,<br/>site, aturan, foto
  API->>DB: BEGIN, simpan form,<br/>jawaban, foto, audit, COMMIT
  DB-->>API: id P2H
  API-->>SPA: 201 hasil stop_aa
  API->>DB: INSERT notifications,<br/>baca perangkat push
  Note over API,DB: Filter penerima: site sama,<br/>bukan pembuat, sesuai mode
  API->>PSH: Kirim push
  PSH-->>PGW: Notifikasi STOP OPERASI
